<title>USA: PSI Industries names Ben Cohen president.</title>
<headline>PSI Industries names Ben Cohen president.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PSI Industries Inc said on Tuesday it named Ben Cohen president, chief operating officer and a board member, effective immediately.</p>
<p>This was a newly-created position, the company said.</p>
<p>Cohen had been president and CEO of Marketing Dynamics Group, a California-based consulting firm.</p>
